### KhujiGo API — manual smoke tests
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy the curl equivalents.
### Run `npm run db:setup` first so the demo data exists.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@customerToken = PASTE_CUSTOMER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminPassword = PASTE_SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD

### Liveness + database check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Catalog (public)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Page 1 of the catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=4

### Search + sort by price ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=watch&sort=price_asc

### Filter by category, only discounted, in stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?categorySlug=gadgets&onSale=true&inStock=true

### Price range
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?minPrice=900&maxPrice=1500&sort=price_desc

### Product detail by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/t900-ultra-2-smartwatch-bangla-support

### Related products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/prod-1/related?limit=3

### Unknown query parameter -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?bogus=1

### Categories with product counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Hero banners
GET {{baseUrl}}/banners

### Delivery pricing
GET {{baseUrl}}/delivery-settings

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Auth
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Customer login (demo account) -> copy accessToken into @customerToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/customer/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "customer@khujigo.com", "password": "customer123" }

### Customer login by phone number
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/customer/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "01712345678", "password": "customer123" }

### Register a new customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/customer/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Buyer",
  "email": "test.buyer@example.com",
  "phone": "01755554444",
  "password": "test1234",
  "division": "dhaka",
  "district": "dhaka-city",
  "area": "Uttara",
  "address": "House 9, Road 3, Uttara, Dhaka"
}

### Profile (requires a customer token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/customer/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Update profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/customer/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "area": "Gulshan", "address": "Road 11, Gulshan 1, Dhaka" }

### Admin login -> copy accessToken into @adminToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@khujigo.com", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

### Admin profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Wrong audience: customer token on an admin route -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Missing token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Coupons
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Fixed discount
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupons/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "KHUJIGO100", "subtotal": 2300 }

### Percentage discount, capped at maxDiscountAmount (10% of 9000 = 900 -> 300)
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupons/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "EID2026", "subtotal": 9000 }

### Below the minimum order amount -> valid: false
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupons/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "KHUJIGO100", "subtotal": 500 }

### Unknown coupon -> valid: false
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupons/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "NOPE", "subtotal": 5000 }

### All coupons (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Checkout
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Place an order (compute totals server-side)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Zubair Hossain",
  "customerPhone": "01712345678",
  "customerEmail": "customer@khujigo.com",
  "division": "dhaka",
  "district": "dhaka-city",
  "area": "Dhanmondi",
  "fullAddress": "House #45, Road #7/A, Dhanmondi R/A, Dhaka",
  "deliveryNotes": "Please call before delivery",
  "paymentMethod": "COD",
  "couponCode": "KHUJIGO100",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "prod-1", "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": "prod-7", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Free delivery at or above the threshold (2 x 1450 = 2900 -> charge 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Zubair Hossain",
  "customerPhone": "01712345678",
  "division": "dhaka",
  "district": "dhaka-city",
  "area": "Dhanmondi",
  "fullAddress": "House #45, Road #7/A, Dhanmondi R/A, Dhaka",
  "paymentMethod": "COD",
  "items": [{ "productId": "prod-1", "quantity": 2 }]
}

### Outside Dhaka -> higher delivery charge
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Nusrat Farhana",
  "customerPhone": "01819876543",
  "division": "chattogram",
  "district": "chattogram",
  "area": "Nasirabad",
  "fullAddress": "Flat 4B, Green View Tower, GEC Circle, Chattogram",
  "paymentMethod": "BKASH",
  "items": [{ "productId": "prod-3", "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Insufficient stock -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Zubair Hossain",
  "customerPhone": "01712345678",
  "division": "dhaka",
  "district": "dhaka-city",
  "area": "Dhanmondi",
  "fullAddress": "House #45, Road #7/A, Dhanmondi R/A, Dhaka",
  "paymentMethod": "COD",
  "items": [{ "productId": "prod-4", "quantity": 999999 }]
}

### Receipt (order id from a previous response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/KG-2026-8941

### My orders (requires a customer token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/mine?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Admin order list with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=PENDING&paymentStatus=UNPAID&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin order search
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?search=0171
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Advance order status (staff is allowed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/KG-2026-8941/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "SHIPPED" }

### Mark an order paid
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/KG-2026-8941/payment-status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentStatus": "PAID" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Reviews
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Approved reviews for a product (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews?productId=prod-1

### Latest approved reviews across the storefront
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews?limit=4

### Submit a review (enters the moderation queue as PENDING)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "prod-1",
  "customerName": "Test Reviewer",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Great watch, Bangla notifications work perfectly."
}

### Moderation queue (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/admin/all?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve a review
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reviews/REPLACE_WITH_REVIEW_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "APPROVED" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Admin catalog writes
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Product listing including DRAFT/ARCHIVED
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/admin/all?status=DRAFT
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameEn": "Manual Test Product",
  "nameBn": "ম্যানুয়াল টেস্ট পণ্য",
  "slug": "manual-test-product",
  "sku": "KG-MAN-999",
  "categoryId": "cat-accessories",
  "brand": "TestBrand",
  "shortDescEn": "Short description",
  "shortDescBn": "সংক্ষিপ্ত বিবরণ",
  "descriptionEn": "Full description",
  "descriptionBn": "সম্পূর্ণ বিবরণ",
  "price": 999,
  "comparePrice": 1499,
  "discountPercent": 33,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "lowStockThreshold": 3,
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://picsum.photos/seed/manualtest/600/600",
  "galleryUrls": ["https://picsum.photos/seed/manualtest/800/800"],
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "isNewArrival": true,
  "tags": ["manual", "test"],
  "specifications": [
    { "keyEn": "Colour", "keyBn": "রং", "valueEn": "Black", "valueBn": "কালো" }
  ]
}

### Set absolute stock
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stockQuantity": 42 }

### Create a coupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "MANUAL25",
  "discountType": "PERCENTAGE",
  "discountValue": 25,
  "minOrderAmount": 2000,
  "maxDiscountAmount": 500,
  "usageLimit": 100,
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "expiryDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59.000Z",
  "isActive": true
}

### Toggle a coupon
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coupons/REPLACE_WITH_COUPON_ID/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update delivery pricing
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/delivery-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "insideDhaka": 70, "outsideDhaka": 130, "freeDeliveryThreshold": 3000 }

### Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
